  "findings": [
    "AMT disables accounts selected by external IDs and display name; no file identity comparison.",
    "AddtoGroup variants compare CN-prefixed membership strings; employee-ID lookup is directory identity, not file content.",
    "BlogCount derives local XML names from a short hostname label; labels can collide. Its previous-month lower bound has no upper bound.",
    "ClearActivesyncpartnerships removes partnerships by last sync age; age is not duplicate proof.",
    "Conference-room permissions and DL_Reprt produce permission/member-count reports.",
    "DLrestrictionFix drops unresolved mailbox/group references and updates a distribution list; no duplicate-file algorithm.",
    "Diskspace reports WMI disk capacity through Excel; ExcelHost2IP reports ping status/address through Excel."
  ],
